  "official_rule": "JP: 【フラッシュ】\nこのバトル中、自分のミ二オン1体をBP+200す\nる。そのミ二オンがバトルに勝利した場合、自分のト EN: [Flash]\nSelect one of your minions to gain +200BP for the duration of this battle.\nIf that minion wins the battle, return one \"Build Up\" from your trash to your hand.",
  "setup": [
